OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to build two new rides on
OL,4,Apier thrown out
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planning appeal for two new rides at
OL,7,FSouth Pier in Blackpool has been thrown
OL,8,Fout by the Planning Inspectorate.
OL,10,FBlackpool Pier Company was challenging
OL,11,Ftwo decisions made by Blackpool Council
OL,12,Ffor a log flume and a star flyer at
OL,13,Feither side of the pier - saying they
OL,14,Fwould provide a major attraction and
OL,15,Fboost tourism.
OL,17,FBlackpool Council had argued that the
OL,18,Frides were inappropriate for the site.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
