OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to build two new rides on
OL,4,Apier thrown out
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Freer, the inspector appointed for
OL,7,Fthe appeal, said the rides would
OL,8,Fconstitute more harm to the seafront
OL,9,Farea than benefit.
